        },
        {
          "text": "kandi abantu ab'omunsi egi obu baraaleetaga ebintu eby'okuguza rundi engano ha kiro kya Sabbato ebintu ebi tiwabibagulehoga, ha kiro kya Sabbato rundi ha kiro ekikuru ekindi; tulireka ebyokulya eby'omwaka gwa musanju, tuleke n'okutonga amabanja goona.",
